      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Mímica. Mime Jr. gosta de imitar tudo o que vê. Ele observa os passos de dança de Mr. Rime e pratica como se fosse seu aprendiz.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Não Descoberto &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Mime Jr. pode evoluir para Mr. Mime no momento em que aprende o Move 'Mimic' caso esteja fora de Galar, ou para Mr. Mime de Galar caso esteja em Galar ou com a ajuda de uma Galar Stone se estiver fora de Galar. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Barrier, Confusion, Pound, Tickle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Copycat</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Meditate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Double Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Mimic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Encore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Protect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Light Screen, Reflect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Substitute</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Recycle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Trick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Baton Pass, Dazzling Gleam, Role Play, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Teeter Dance</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Brick Break, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dream Eater, Facade, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Icy Wind, Infestation, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Misty Terrain, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Taunt, Telekinesis, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Wonder Room, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Charm, Confuse Ray, Fake Out, Future Sight, Healing Wish, Hypnosis, Icy Wind, Magic Room, Mimic, Nasty Plot, Power Split, Psychic Terrain, Teeter Dance, Tickle, Trick, Wake-Up Slap</p>",
